  {
   "id": "time-to-wake-up-257932@1.1.0",
   "gameId": "time-to-wake-up-257932",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.0",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-21T07:02:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are now a little bit over a week since launch and we have some exciting news! Earlier, we mentioned that we were looking into adding more languages and now, we've updated Time To Wake Up to v.1.1.0, which now supports Ukrainian, Polish, and Russian. Here are the patch notes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "V.1.1.0",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added Ukrainian, Polish & Russian language support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added error pop-up on exit if SteamAPI fails to initialize",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed door clipping through wall in nightmare playground (Nightmare)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Meanwhile, it's been motivating for the whole team to read your thoughtful reviews! They really make a difference for us, so consider leaving one if you haven't already. We want to know how you experienced Time To Wake Up and how we can make it better.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've already learned that you would really appreciate rebinding keys (to map the controls however you like) and a chapter select option (to unlock achievements easier), both are features we're currently working on.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "digest": {
