  {
   "id": "time-to-wake-up-257932@major-2026-06-02",
   "gameId": "time-to-wake-up-257932",
   "displayName": "The Steam Next Fest Demo Update is here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-02T08:54:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's June and that means that Time To Wake Up will soon be featured in Steam Next Fest! Leading up to the event, we've decided to push one more update that addresses some of the issues that players have experienced while adding some small features.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The demo has now been updated from v.0.2.2 to v.0.2.3 and down below, you can read the list of changes:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "v.0.2.3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added music variations between blink environments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added music tracks to the record players in the bedrooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added bully's grunt in the first hallway",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added sound effect to journal unlock notification",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added cutscene take-over when assembling locker staircase",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added button to main menu that links to our QQ page",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased idle time threshold (time before idle dialogues start playing)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved keyboard/controller selection in the UI / Journal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Made journal pages scrollable using controller shoulder buttons (LB/RB, L1/R1)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved path tracking, preventing player from spawning in an invalid location when blinking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed locker pick-up sound effect",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed journal pages not being unlocked after loading a save",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed prompts showing up while journal is open",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed player jumping when exiting the journal on controller",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Samantha's letter being visible before receiving it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed 'life' paper disappearing when blinking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed player falling sound playing when returning to the main menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed FOV change pop when exiting the bedroom pit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam Next Fest marks an important milestone for us, because it means it won't be that long anymore until we finally release the game and share Time To Wake Up with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "For now, we're going to shift our focus back to finishing the full game. We will be in touch soon. In the meantime, enjoy Steam Next Fest and remember you are always welcome in our Discord",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(https://discord.gg/2vQetpcpRy)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
